OL,3,APope to be discharged days after lung
OL,4,Acancer surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV will be discharged from
OL,7,FRome's Gemelli Hospital on Saturday
OL,8,Fafternoon, just four days after an
OL,9,Foperation to remove a cancerous growth
OL,10,Ffrom his lung.
OL,12,FThe Vatican said the Pope will give the
OL,13,Ftraditional Angelus prayer and blessing
OL,14,Fto a crowd in St Peter's Square on
OL,15,FSunday, as he did last week when he
OL,16,Fsurprised the world by announcing the
OL,17,Fsurgery.
OL,19,FOn Friday, photographs were released of
OL,20,Fthe Pope celebrating Mass and
OL,21,Fdistributing communion in hospital for
OL,22,Fstaff.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
